Conclusion:
In this lab, a 15-bit adder-subtractor was designed using a hierarchical approach with 3-bit modules. This modular design made the system more efficient and easier to manage. The design was tested with various inputs, and the results showed it works correctly for addition, subtraction, carry, and overflow cases. This project highlights the benefits of hierarchical design in simplifying complex systems.

